  "id": "silver-tempest-build-battle-box",
  "name": "Silver Tempest Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Silver Tempest prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 29–30 October and 5–6 November 2022, and sold by shops in the Prerelease Program. Each box held four Silver Tempest booster packs and a 40-card deck built around one of four promos with the Silver Tempest logo. The decks also held non-holo copies of Rapidash and Archeops, which booster packs have only in holofoil, and Brilliant Stars' non-holo Professor's Research again.",
